# Every .env variant, not just .env and .env.local.
#
# A backup taken before editing .env - .env.backup, .env.bak, .env.old - holds
# exactly the same secrets as the file it copied, and it lands in the repo root
# where "git add -A" sweeps it into a commit. That is how .env.backup-before-smtp
# reached main carrying a live Gmail App Password, JWT_SECRET, INTERNAL_API_KEY,
# QR_AES_KEY and the database passwords.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log*

# TypeScript's incremental build cache. Regenerated by tsc on every compile, so
# tracking it means everyone sees it as modified after every build and it
# conflicts on most merges. It was committed by accident.
*.tsbuildinfo
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.tsbuildinfo

